                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "30e8b276-9456-449c-8367-464d49c2b5af",
                                "sense_id": "1d4083f7-7699-3468-add4-ffb927f6a53e",
                                "text": "enables the Soul fiducially to close with and rest upon that Object"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "50a87491-3c2c-490f-8ee0-622c912672e3",
                                "sense_id": "1d4083f7-7699-3468-add4-ffb927f6a53e",
                                "text": "This I call an acting fiducially; that is, with a believing persuasion and particular application."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48de8f9a-01d5-4ded-9af5-afdf75274973",
                                "sense_id": "1d4083f7-7699-3468-add4-ffb927f6a53e",
                                "text": "Their ethics were supported by the Hippocratic principle of doing no harm, a deontological imperative that was realized fiducially through the physician's relationship to the patient."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ab3b213b-32e2-38c5-864c-c8473d2183c4",
                        "entry_id": "7203897d-030e-3d63-84d8-0d4d3c4bb02e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a fiducial manner; using or as a reference marker."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd5ae82d-0c85-4d00-ab7d-01cf64f3df78",
                                "sense_id": "ab3b213b-32e2-38c5-864c-c8473d2183c4",
                                "text": "A very perfect internal collimating telescope, with means under the observers hand of adjusting fiducially the line of collimation without the intervention of an assistant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "737375bb-4f9a-4482-9539-c84768766fed",
                                "sense_id": "ab3b213b-32e2-38c5-864c-c8473d2183c4",
                                "text": "Then take the micrometer reading, using the indicator fiducially."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "45d98834-35b8-4212-9075-40884eff3c6b",
                                "sense_id": "ab3b213b-32e2-38c5-864c-c8473d2183c4",
                                "text": "Respiratory gating with fiducially based respiratory motion tracking on a robotic radio-surgery system exemplifies a forerunner of more advanced fiducially based tracking systems [36]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "45d42aa7-4ff6-3354-8a24-4c041d895f66",
                        "entry_id": "7203897d-030e-3d63-84d8-0d4d3c4bb02e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Synonym of fiducial (accepted as a basis of reference)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "proscribed"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "48adf90a-4752-49dd-84d1-431b94421487",
                                "sense_id": "45d42aa7-4ff6-3354-8a24-4c041d895f66",
                                "text": "The success profit AG2(Y) is below the fiducially point Alpha, AG2(Y) < AG1 (X) exist and the success profit AG1(X) is over the fiducially point Beta."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c4f3302-665a-48c3-9120-a26961b2142f",
                                "sense_id": "45d42aa7-4ff6-3354-8a24-4c041d895f66",
                                "text": "Cluster outlines are dealt with as combinatorial associations in which, for each fiducially point, a stream from an alternate illustration experience can be chosen, in this way making a very helpful plan. This plan is printed to new face pictures to successfully discover the fiducially factors in the photo."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "15e2eb53-cc11-4216-9910-163b67e05340",
                                "sense_id": "45d42aa7-4ff6-3354-8a24-4c041d895f66",
                                "text": "Dick et al. [151] employed an ANN model to track irradiation of the liver without using fiducially tumors to monitor the lung-diaphragm boundary."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4c212a45-9fcc-3cf7-9e30-564fc576fbfe",
                        "entry_id": "7203897d-030e-3d63-84d8-0d4d3c4bb02e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pertaining to or based on the correspondence between a parameter in a sample and the same parameter in the population from which the sample was drawn."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a312877-3c1a-419b-8d59-b503927a1aa9",
                                "sense_id": "4c212a45-9fcc-3cf7-9e30-564fc576fbfe",
                                "text": "Closely related to the tests that have previously been described is the notion of fiducially related values of σ and s."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af23ce85-7609-4b82-b0bd-ce8ee3b9d020",
                                "sense_id": "4c212a45-9fcc-3cf7-9e30-564fc576fbfe",
                                "text": "In arguing fiducially about the value of a parameter, a procedure applicable to some of the simple cases begins by the calculation from the sample of an estimate of the parameter in question."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ca5350e-4b24-4fed-8984-09378e7f58ae",
                                "sense_id": "4c212a45-9fcc-3cf7-9e30-564fc576fbfe",
                                "text": "That is to say, we might consider the exponent (τ₀ - μ)/Θ to be distributed fiducially as a weighted sum of two Chi-squares."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c61737c4-7c64-33a2-ad82-7de7b4f11b55",
                        "entry_id": "7203897d-030e-3d63-84d8-0d4d3c4bb02e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a fiduciary manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7bf65fb3-735a-4efa-a3ea-2f0bbb3614f8",
                                "sense_id": "c61737c4-7c64-33a2-ad82-7de7b4f11b55",
                                "text": "Be it further enacted, That all libraries &c. held fiducially or individually for seminary or church objects, shall be alike exempt from taxation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57f50d06-0440-4cc1-ab88-7157cb157eee",
                                "sense_id": "c61737c4-7c64-33a2-ad82-7de7b4f11b55",
                                "text": "Where plan was part owner of mortgages, other investors were not fiducially liable to plan"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b83f9791-c707-4c8f-b18c-f7b556b72a80",
                                "sense_id": "c61737c4-7c64-33a2-ad82-7de7b4f11b55",
                                "text": "The logic of the Audit is fiducially incompetent and wrong, and following it will lead to steadily increasing catastrophic forest fire acreage and exponentially greater cost-plus-losses in the future."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
